{"slug": "software-buying-checklist", "title": "Software Buying Checklist for Studios (Printable)", "description": "Printable checklist for choosing martial arts, dance or yoga studio software: features, real cost, processing fees, data export and trial tests.", "h1": "Software buying checklist for studios", "keyword": "studio software checklist", "type": "checklist", "tools": [], "trades": ["martial", "bjj", "dance", "yoga"], "body": "<style>.sub{background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:14px 16px;margin:1rem 0}.sub h2{margin:0 0 .3rem;font-size:1.1rem}.sub p{margin:.2rem 0 .6rem;color:var(--mut)}.sub .lbl{flex-basis:100%;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem}.sub .row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.sub input[type=email]{flex:1 1 220px;padding:9px 12px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;font:inherit}.sub button{padding:9px 16px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.sub button:hover{background:var(--brand-d)}.ck{padding-left:0}.ck li{margin:.4rem 0;list-style:none}.ck input{margin-right:.5rem}@media print{header,footer,.trust,.noprint,h2#faq-h{display:none}}</style><p>A practical checklist for martial arts schools, BJJ gyms, and dance and yoga studios comparing management software. Tick items as you go, or print it and take it to demos.</p><p class='noprint'><button type='button' onclick='window.print()'>Print or save as PDF</button></p><form action=\"https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/stackguide\" method=\"post\" class=\"embeddable-buttondown-form sub noprint\"><h2>Get updates</h2><p>Occasional emails when software prices change or we publish a new guide. Unsubscribe anytime.</p><div class=\"row\"><label for=\"bd-email\" class=\"lbl\">Email address</label><input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" id=\"bd-email\" required placeholder=\"you@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"tag\" value=\"studiostackguide\"><button type=\"submit\">Get updates</button></div></form><h2>1. Must-have features</h2><ul class='ck'><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Recurring memberships with automatic retry of failed payments</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Family accounts (one payer, several students) if you teach kids</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Belt or rank tracking with attendance-based promotion readiness (martial arts)</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Class booking, waitlists and class packs or drop-ins (dance and yoga)</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Check-in method that fits your front desk: kiosk, barcode or app</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Online waivers and sign-up forms</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Lead capture and trial-class follow-up</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Reports you actually use: active members, cancellations, revenue by program</label></li></ul><h2>2. Real cost</h2><ul class='ck'><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Write down your active-customer or member count today and in 12 months; most tools price by it</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Get the published monthly price at <em>both</em> counts, in writing if it's quoted</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Ask for the card processing rate and per-transaction fee, and whether you can use your own processor</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Ask whether there's a platform fee or revenue percentage on top of processing</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>List the add-ons you'd need (branded app, website, texting, extra locations or users) and their monthly prices</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Confirm contract length, auto-renewal, cancellation notice and any setup or exit fee</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Ask whether annual billing is discounted and whether the discount is refundable if you leave</label></li></ul><h2>3. Your data</h2><ul class='ck'><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Confirm you can export customers, payment history and notes yourself, in CSV, at any time</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Ask who moves your data in, what it costs, and how long it takes</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Ask how stored cards or recurring billing move over without customers re-entering cards</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Check what happens to your data after you cancel and for how long you can download it</label></li></ul><h2>4. Trial and decision</h2><ul class='ck'><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Start a trial and run one real week through it, not just the demo</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Test the mobile app as a staff member and as a customer</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Time how long the most common task takes (booking, check-in, quoting)</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Contact support once during the trial and note how fast and useful the answer is</label></li><li><label><input type='checkbox'>Ask two current users in your niche (forums, local groups) what they'd change</label></li></ul><p class='noprint'>Compare published prices: <a href=\"/martial-arts-software-pricing/\">pricing by student count</a> · <a href=\"/best-martial-arts-school-software/\">best martial arts software</a> · <a href=\"/best-dance-studio-software/\">dance and yoga studio software</a> · <a href=\"/membership-revenue-calculator/\">revenue calculator</a></p>", "faq": [["What's the most overlooked cost in studio software?", "Payment processing and platform fees. Many vendors don't publish their processing rate, so ask for it in writing and plug it into our revenue calculator."], ["Can I get the checklist as a PDF?", "Yes. Use the Print button and choose 'Save as PDF'."], ["Should I pick software before opening a studio?", "Set it up before you take your first payments, so memberships, waivers and attendance live in one place from day one."]]}